>> When is it ever worth blessing a
>> stack of rocks?  Blessed ammo
>> disappears less often.
>
> Can I bless and enchant a stack of rocks?
> (Can they even be wielded?)

Anything can be blessed so rocks can be blessed.  All items do have an
enchantment field in the structure but not all item types ever use it so
rocks can't be enhanced.  Any item can be wielded and the damage caused
by items not weapons or weapon-tools is based on weight (there is a
table of detailed exceptions to this generality).  One rock does a lot
less damage than any good weapon. A stack of fifty rocks does much
more damage but isn't worth carrying.

What I do with rocks is I check their inventory letter and I set them
as my quiver.  Or I throw them by letter.  Or I ignore them or polypile
them.

